        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Un seul des puissants croassements de ce Pokémon nocturne lui permet de rassembler une centaine de Cornèbre, ses sous-fifres.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "A single cry from this nocturnal Pokémon, and more than a hundred of its Murkrow cronies will assemble.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "夜行性。　一声　鳴けば １００匹を　超える　子分の ヤミカラスが　集結する。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "えものを　とるのを　しっぱいしたり うらぎった　こぶんの　ヤミカラスを どこまでも　おいつめ　しょぶんする。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Si l’un de ses sous-fifres Cornèbre a le malheur de le décevoir ou d’échouer dans sa mission, le Corboss le pourchassera sans le moindre répit.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "If its Murkrow cronies fail to catch food for it, or if it feels they have betrayed it, it will hunt them down wherever they are and punish them.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "獲物を　捕るのを　失敗したり 裏切った　子分の　ヤミカラスを どこまでも　追い詰め　処分する。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "しっぱいしたり　うらぎった　こぶんは ぜったいに　ゆるさない。　むれの ちつじょを　まもるため　やむないのだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il ne pardonne jamais la trahison ou la défaite d’un subordonné. Le bien-être de l’ensemble de la volée en dépend.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It will absolutely not forgive failure from or betrayal by its goons. It has no choice in this if it wants to maintain the order of the flock.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "失敗したり　裏切った　子分は 絶対に　許さない。　群れの 秩序を　守るため　やむないのだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "てきと　たたかうのは　ほぼ　こぶん。 じぶんの　てを　よごすのは　あいてに さいごの　とどめを　さすときだけ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ses sous-fifres font le sale boulot pour lui. Il n’intervient en combat que pour donner le coup de grâce à son ennemi.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Its goons take care of most of the fighting for it. The only time it dirties its own hands is in delivering a final blow to finish off an opponent.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "敵と　戦うのは　ほぼ　子分。 自分の　手を　汚すのは　相手に 最後の　止めを　刺すときだけ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "One cry from this Pokémon, and a murder of Murkrow come flying. At such times, one would think the curtain of night had fallen, plunging the world into jet-black darkness.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "legends-arceus",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/39/"
        }
      }
